WEBVTT

01:30.000 --> 01:33.000
Mother...!

01:37.000 --> 01:40.000
Mother...!

01:46.000 --> 01:47.800
Help...!

02:58.000 --> 02:59.800
Help!

03:22.600 --> 03:24.600
Are you all right, Jiujin?

03:24.600 --> 03:27.000
Yes. This uncle saved me

03:29.000 --> 03:31.000
Thank you for saving Jiujin

03:31.000 --> 03:36.000
Don't mention it. I should thank you
for sparing my life the other day

03:36.000 --> 03:38.000
Think nothing of it

03:39.800 --> 03:41.800
Get out of here now!

03:42.000 --> 03:45.800
You're injured. You go with Jiujin.
I'll cover you

03:48.000 --> 03:49.000
Take care

03:51.000 --> 03:52.400
You too

04:12.000 --> 04:14.000
Shou, what's that?

04:14.000 --> 04:16.000
Why did you bring this monster back?

04:16.600 --> 04:21.600
I didn't. The Deity of Plague sent it
to wreak havoc. We must get rid of it!

04:21.600 --> 04:22.600
Run!

05:26.000 --> 05:27.400
Shou!

05:36.000 --> 05:38.000
I'll die together with you!

05:38.000 --> 05:40.600
No, Shou!

05:48.000 --> 05:50.000
Shou!

06:07.800 --> 06:10.000
Shou...!

06:10.600 --> 06:12.600
Are you all right?

06:18.000 --> 06:20.600
Shou!

06:23.000 --> 06:27.000
Wake up, Shou...!

06:28.000 --> 06:31.000
Uncle, wake up...!

06:31.000 --> 06:33.000
What happened?

06:33.000 --> 06:37.000
Sorry, Auntie. He got injured
while trying to save us

06:38.000 --> 06:42.000
Don't be upset.
Shou will be all right

06:42.800 --> 06:46.800
That's right. He'll pull through
since he's such a kindhearted man

06:47.000 --> 06:50.000
We must get him the best doctor!

06:50.000 --> 06:56.600
He is the best doctor, but he's now
in a coma. Who else can save him?

06:57.000 --> 07:00.000
To think my son will be gone
before me...!

07:02.000 --> 07:06.000
-Uncle...!
-Wake up, Shou...!

07:06.000 --> 07:10.000
Shou did everything for us

07:11.000 --> 07:17.000
He's not 30 yet. If he's gone now, he
won't live up to his name as Longevity

07:17.000 --> 07:21.000
Wake up, Shou...!

07:25.000 --> 07:30.000
There's a drought. We don't have
any more water to brew medicine for Shou

07:38.000 --> 07:40.000
The Deity of Plague is to blame!

07:41.000 --> 07:44.600
Shou is dying.
What are we going to do?

07:46.000 --> 07:50.000
If we can make boundless good fortune
and longevity happen,

07:50.000 --> 07:53.600
miracles will happen
and Shou will be saved

07:55.000 --> 08:00.000
That's impossible.
Do you know the Eastern Sea?

08:00.000 --> 08:05.000
Its waves surge for 300 years
and recede for another 300 years

08:05.000 --> 08:07.600
We can't possibly go against Nature

08:08.000 --> 08:12.000
Besides, we don't know what longevity
comparable to the mountains means

08:14.000 --> 08:20.000
Are we just going to let Shou pass on
without doing anything then?

08:22.000 --> 08:25.600
If he's fated to pass on,
there's nothing we can do

08:29.000 --> 08:34.600
We can only pray to Heaven
to bring us rain...

08:35.000 --> 08:37.600
so we can get out of
the spell of drought

08:38.000 --> 08:41.600
That's easy to say.
How do we pray for rain?

08:41.600 --> 08:47.000
The reverend once told me
when one is in trouble,

08:47.000 --> 08:51.000
one will be saved if one prays
to the Goddess of Mercy sincerely

08:53.000 --> 08:55.000
Let's pray to Her!

08:56.000 --> 09:01.000
That's the only way out.
We'll get everybody to pray with us!

09:18.000 --> 09:20.600
Uncle has come to, Granny!

09:21.000 --> 09:23.000
Shou, you've come to!

09:24.000 --> 09:26.800
Shou...!

09:27.000 --> 09:29.000
Uncle!

09:33.000 --> 09:36.000
Heaven, I'm going to
give the people...

09:36.000 --> 09:40.000
all the good fortune I've accumulated
over the years by doing good deeds

09:41.000 --> 09:45.600
I'd rather let the people have it
than become an immortal myself

09:46.000 --> 09:49.000
Please rain to save the people!

10:15.000 --> 10:16.400
Look!

10:21.800 --> 10:22.800
Lu!

10:33.000 --> 10:35.000
Great! It's raining!

10:36.000 --> 10:38.000
We did it!

10:39.000 --> 10:41.000
It's raining!

10:45.000 --> 10:50.000
Look!
Shou has come round!

10:50.000 --> 10:53.000
Shou has come round!

10:54.000 --> 10:59.000
Shou! We did it!
We succeeded in pleading for rain!

10:59.600 --> 11:00.600
Look!

11:05.000 --> 11:07.000
Hang on!

11:08.000 --> 11:11.000
Do you call this
boundless good fortune?

11:11.000 --> 11:13.000
What makes you say that?

11:13.000 --> 11:17.000
You threw many characters of
"fortune" into the air just now

11:17.000 --> 11:20.600
When they came down,
they covered the earth

11:20.600 --> 11:24.000
Didn't that look like
boundless good fortune?

11:24.000 --> 11:25.000
That's right!

11:27.000 --> 11:29.000
Shou has passed out again!

11:47.000 --> 11:50.000
Must we make longevity comparable to
the mountains happen too?

11:50.000 --> 11:54.000
Are we to move to the mountains
to save Shou?

11:54.000 --> 11:56.000
Let's just try!

12:17.800 --> 12:18.800
Halt!

12:32.800 --> 12:37.600
Let's hope Shou will come to
quickly and live on

12:38.000 --> 12:43.000
He sacrificed himself to save us.
We should give him our lives

12:54.600 --> 12:56.000
Shou...

12:57.000 --> 12:59.000
Easy...

13:05.000 --> 13:08.000
Shou!

13:10.000 --> 13:11.600
Shou!

13:13.000 --> 13:15.000
Wake up, Shou!

13:18.000 --> 13:22.000
Wake up, Shou...!

13:30.000 --> 13:32.000
Wake up, Uncle!

13:34.000 --> 13:36.000
Uncle has come to!

13:36.600 --> 13:37.600
Uncle!

13:41.000 --> 13:44.000
I'm all right!

13:44.000 --> 13:45.600
Look!

13:47.000 --> 13:49.000
"Longevity"?
Shou!

13:49.000 --> 13:52.600
This is longevity comparable
to the mountains!

13:58.000 --> 14:00.000
We've made it happen!

14:00.000 --> 14:03.000
Good fortune
as boundless as the seas,

14:03.000 --> 14:06.000
and longevity comparable to
the mountains!

14:15.000 --> 14:17.000
Don't make me worry in future, son

14:19.000 --> 14:24.000
We've made the phenomena happen and
there's peace and harmony everywhere

14:24.000 --> 14:27.000
I've become more and more
confident of myself

14:27.000 --> 14:30.000
I doubt there's anything
I can't do

14:31.000 --> 14:34.800
It's important to be confident

14:42.000 --> 14:44.400
What's going on?
Don't be afraid!

14:46.000 --> 14:48.600
Granny, the Spider Spirit
is here again!

14:49.000 --> 14:51.000
Don't panic.
It's the Deity of Plague

14:51.000 --> 14:53.000
Brother-in-law, protect Mother!

14:53.000 --> 14:56.000
Mother, go home quickly!
Datou, protect them!

14:57.000 --> 14:59.000
Be careful!

15:05.000 --> 15:08.000
Come out, Deity of Plague!

15:13.600 --> 15:15.000
It's Zhang Guolao!

15:15.000 --> 15:20.000
Relax. The Jade Emperor
has learnt all about it

15:21.000 --> 15:26.000
Since you've made
the phenomena happen,

15:27.000 --> 15:31.000
please stretch out your hands
and join them,

15:32.000 --> 15:34.000
and see what happens

15:41.000 --> 15:46.000
That's right. Put your hands together
and golden lights will shine

15:46.000 --> 15:52.600
You've re-attained immortality

15:53.000 --> 15:55.000
Come with me

15:56.000 --> 15:58.000
We can't!

15:58.000 --> 16:01.000
We still have important things to do

16:01.000 --> 16:04.600
That's right. We aren't ready
to see the Jade Emperor yet

16:05.000 --> 16:07.000
You're weird, Longevity

16:07.000 --> 16:12.600
I understand they can't bear to part
with Princess Ruining and Yu Shuangxi

16:13.000 --> 16:18.000
But if you go to Heaven, you'll be
able to see Ma-gu. You should be happy

16:18.000 --> 16:22.000
It has nothing to do with her.
We haven't got rid of the Deity of Plague

16:22.000 --> 16:27.600
He'll continue to wreak havoc. We must
remove him before we return to Heaven

16:28.000 --> 16:32.600
That's right.
We'd have lived in vain otherwise

16:33.000 --> 16:37.000
Please let the Jade Emperor know
we must destroy the Deity of Plague...

16:37.000 --> 16:39.000
or we'll be letting the mortals down

16:40.000 --> 16:43.000
We'll present the head of the Deity
of Plague to the Jade Emperor!

16:43.000 --> 16:44.000
Right!

16:44.000 --> 16:49.600
All right, quickly subdue
the Deity of Plague

16:50.000 --> 16:56.400
Only when you've done that will
the mortal world enjoy good fortune

16:57.000 --> 17:02.600
I wish you success.
Goodbye

17:03.000 --> 17:05.000
See you!

17:07.600 --> 17:13.600
Let's look for the Deity of Plague now.
We'll save the people from disasters!

17:29.000 --> 17:33.000
This place has an aura of evil.
He must be hiding here

17:33.000 --> 17:36.800
Why does he keep making trouble
in the mortal world?

17:37.000 --> 17:42.000
Unless there's no more greed,
anger and infatuation in men,

17:42.000 --> 17:45.000
he'll always get a chance
to wreak havoc

17:45.800 --> 17:50.000
We must get rid of him so he won't
be able to do evil anymore!

17:50.000 --> 17:51.000
Right!

19:20.000 --> 19:23.000
Shou, Lu, how are you?

19:24.000 --> 19:26.000
It's so hot!

19:27.000 --> 19:29.000
It's hot, Lu!

19:31.000 --> 19:33.000
Why is my bum so hot?

19:33.000 --> 19:36.000
Can't you see we're
surrounded by fire?

19:46.000 --> 19:49.000
We meet again, Three Stars!

19:49.800 --> 19:51.800
What do you want?

19:52.000 --> 19:55.000
Why is there a ring of fire?

19:55.000 --> 19:57.800
What do you want, you evil thing?!

20:00.000 --> 20:03.000
Why is there a cauldron here?

20:03.000 --> 20:06.000
You can't make pills out of us!

20:06.800 --> 20:08.800
I hate you!

20:09.000 --> 20:13.000
I'm going to eat you up
to appease my hatred

20:14.000 --> 20:17.600
And after eating you,
I'll enjoy longevity!

20:19.800 --> 20:24.800
After doing so much evil,
you still want to eat us! You rat!

20:25.000 --> 20:28.000
There's the dark side of men

20:28.000 --> 20:32.600
If you're always good to them,
they'll tend to do wicked things

20:33.000 --> 20:35.800
My duty is to punish them

20:36.000 --> 20:42.600
I'm the only one who can make them
tell good from bad

20:42.600 --> 20:48.600
What nonsense! You deserve death for
claiming many lives in an epidermic

20:48.600 --> 20:50.600
Eating us won't help!

20:51.000 --> 20:55.600
I deserve death?
You ought to worry about yourselves

20:56.000 --> 21:01.000
You'll see how I eat you up!

21:04.000 --> 21:08.000
After eating you,
my life will be as long as Heaven's

21:09.000 --> 21:13.000
I'll become the supreme ruler
both in Heaven and on earth!

21:15.000 --> 21:20.000
Fu, I don't want to
turn into charcoal!

21:20.000 --> 21:24.000
Quick, think of a way out, Lu!

21:24.000 --> 21:27.600
Be quiet!
I'm racking my brains!

21:35.000 --> 21:37.000
It's so hot...!

22:14.000 --> 22:16.000
Why did the fire go out?

22:43.000 --> 22:49.600
We'll give you a chance to repent.
Come with us to see the Jade Emperor

22:50.000 --> 22:52.600
You can't get away.
Surrender yourself!

22:54.000 --> 22:55.600
Never!

22:55.600 --> 22:58.600
In that case, meet your doom!

22:59.000 --> 23:03.000
It's still not known
who'll have the last laugh!

26:26.000 --> 26:28.600
Let me out...!

26:32.800 --> 26:35.600
Look what this is

26:38.000 --> 26:41.600
Aren't you ruthless
to turn me into a tortoise!

26:42.000 --> 26:45.000
You really are the Deity of Plague?

26:45.000 --> 26:47.000
You think I'm joking with you?

26:49.000 --> 26:53.000
Great. Now that you can only crawl,
you won't be able to do any evil

26:54.000 --> 26:56.000
That's so unhygienic!

26:59.000 --> 27:02.000
Oh, aren't you adorable!

27:02.000 --> 27:08.000
It's better for you to be a tortoise
than the Deity of Plague

27:08.000 --> 27:14.000
Now you can amuse people, and after
your death, you can be used as medicine

27:18.000 --> 27:23.000
Congratulations!
You've become immortals again!

27:38.000 --> 27:41.000
Congratulations!

27:43.000 --> 27:45.000
What are we hugging each other for?

27:45.000 --> 27:48.000
-You know, I'm rather angry
-Why? This is a happy occasion

27:48.000 --> 27:52.800
You actually couldn't recognize me
at the Eastern Sea then. You rascals!

27:53.000 --> 27:55.000
What's the big deal?

27:55.000 --> 28:00.000
Well, since we were rascals,
we couldn't possibly remember you

28:00.000 --> 28:01.000
Well said

28:01.000 --> 28:05.000
Zhang Guolao,
you're indeed a friend

28:05.000 --> 28:09.000
Not only did you enter my dream,
you even appeared to help us

28:09.000 --> 28:12.000
I'm so touched!

28:14.000 --> 28:19.000
What I did was nothing
compared to your confidante

28:24.000 --> 28:26.000
How is she?

28:38.600 --> 28:41.600
Our respects to Jade Emperor
and Queen Mother

28:42.000 --> 28:48.000
Having gone through the mill,
do you think you've grown in age...

28:48.000 --> 28:51.000
as well as wisdom?

28:55.000 --> 28:57.000
Thank you for your praises

28:57.000 --> 29:02.000
Indeed the three disasters
and nine tribulations...

29:02.000 --> 29:05.000
were quite an experience to us

29:05.000 --> 29:08.000
We'll always bear them in mind

29:09.000 --> 29:12.000
One who has never suffered
isn't a hero

29:13.000 --> 29:16.600
It's good that you've all
become heroes

29:19.000 --> 29:23.000
Though you were only in the
mortal world for a short period,

29:23.000 --> 29:29.000
you mended your ways, cultivated
your mind, fought against plague,

29:29.000 --> 29:32.600
and helped the people of Ping'an Town

29:35.000 --> 29:38.000
Not only that,
you exposed a conspiracy,

29:38.000 --> 29:44.600
defeated the Deity of Plague
and got rid of the Spider Spirit

29:45.000 --> 29:47.000
You've rendered great service

29:47.000 --> 29:50.000
Thank you for your praises

29:50.000 --> 29:56.000
Make your request. So long as
it's reasonable, I'll grant you

29:57.000 --> 30:01.000
Please release Ma-gu

30:05.000 --> 30:07.000
Just as I expected

30:08.000 --> 30:13.000
So do you think their request
is a reasonable one?

30:14.000 --> 30:18.000
Ma-gu did what she did
out of affection

30:18.000 --> 30:19.000
Indeed

30:19.000 --> 30:22.600
She was a great help to the Trio

30:23.000 --> 30:26.000
It wasn't easy for a woman
to do all that at all

30:26.000 --> 30:31.000
She sacrificed herself to help
her friends in times of need

30:31.000 --> 30:33.000
I'm so touched!

30:34.600 --> 30:39.600
Everybody is talking about
her noble act

30:40.000 --> 30:44.000
Good news never goes beyond the gate
while bad news spreads a thousand li away

30:45.000 --> 30:49.000
Please let her off

30:51.800 --> 30:53.800
Please be merciful!

30:56.000 --> 30:58.600
Please be merciful!

30:59.000 --> 31:03.000
I never said I'd lock her up forever

31:05.600 --> 31:11.000
Frankly, I really miss the wine
she brews sometimes

31:11.000 --> 31:13.600
Thank you!

31:14.000 --> 31:15.600
Get up

31:19.000 --> 31:22.000
All right, I'll release Ma-gu

31:22.000 --> 31:28.000
But I forbid you to see her
in the Celestial Court again

31:28.000 --> 31:30.000
-Why?
-No idea

31:31.000 --> 31:33.000
Why can't I see her again?

31:56.000 --> 31:58.000
Ma-gu, I've come!

31:59.000 --> 32:02.000
Congratulations!
You've been released!

32:03.000 --> 32:05.000
How come it's you?

32:05.000 --> 32:09.000
I came to tell you the good news.
Let's go

32:09.000 --> 32:11.000
The Three Stars are back?

32:12.000 --> 32:13.000
Yes

32:13.000 --> 32:16.600
-How are they?
-They're perfectly fine

32:17.000 --> 32:21.000
The Queen Mother even said
they looked more charming...

32:21.000 --> 32:23.000
after their trip to the mortal world

32:23.000 --> 32:25.000
-You're lying
-I'm lying?

32:25.000 --> 32:29.800
If everything was well,
why didn't he come?

32:34.000 --> 32:39.000
Trust you to hem and haw
when I need to know something

32:39.000 --> 32:41.000
I'll go and find out from
the Jade Emperor

32:41.000 --> 32:43.000
Don't be rash

32:46.000 --> 32:51.000
The Jade Emperor forbids you
to see each other again

33:25.000 --> 33:30.600
Please let Fu come back soon.
I miss him so much...

33:30.600 --> 33:36.000
Thinking of Fu again? The Three Stars
grant every wish we make

33:36.000 --> 33:38.000
Fu will come back for sure

33:38.600 --> 33:43.600
Mother, everybody is saying
the Longevity Star is actually Shou

33:44.000 --> 33:48.000
I don't want him to be an immortal.
I just want him by my side

33:48.000 --> 33:51.600
Please see that he comes back soon

33:53.000 --> 33:56.600
Your Highness, the Three Star Temple
is lively once again

33:57.000 --> 34:00.600
It's all thanks to the Three Stars...

34:00.600 --> 34:06.600
we've been enjoying harmony
and good harvests all this while

34:07.000 --> 34:11.000
Good.
I'm glad everybody is living in peace

34:13.000 --> 34:15.000
It's you, Your Highness!

34:15.000 --> 34:16.000
Magistrate Shi

34:18.000 --> 34:20.000
There's been no news of them

34:20.600 --> 34:23.600
-Did they contact you?
-No

34:28.600 --> 34:32.600
It's New Year, Auntie.
It's an auspicious occasion

34:33.000 --> 34:36.600
The moment I think of Fu,
I can't help...

34:37.000 --> 34:42.000
It's New Year. We should be happy.
Don't dwell on unhappy things

34:42.000 --> 34:44.000
Let's go and have our meals!

34:44.800 --> 34:46.800
It's New Year.
Cheer up

34:47.000 --> 34:48.000
I will

34:49.000 --> 34:53.000
Talk some sense into her,
Your Highness. She refuses to eat

34:55.000 --> 34:59.000
-What's the matter, Shuangxi?
-I'm all right

34:59.000 --> 35:01.000
Stop putting on a brave front

35:02.000 --> 35:08.000
Fu is to blame for the state she's in.
He just disappeared into thin air

35:08.000 --> 35:13.600
She pulls a long face all day
as a result

35:15.000 --> 35:18.600
If he comes back,
I'll chop him up into two

35:19.800 --> 35:23.800
Fuqi-ge must have been held up.
Otherwise, he'd come back for sure

35:25.000 --> 35:27.000
I'm washing my hands of you!

35:27.000 --> 35:31.000
This is to celebrate New Year and
the completion of the renovation work

35:31.000 --> 35:34.000
I wish everybody prosperity!

35:37.000 --> 35:38.000
Serve the dishes!

35:38.000 --> 35:39.000
Boundless Fortune!

35:40.000 --> 35:42.000
Exuberant prosperity!

35:43.000 --> 35:44.600
Affectionate longevity!

35:46.000 --> 35:50.600
This voice sounds like Shou's

36:16.000 --> 36:18.000
Why are you back all of a sudden?

36:18.000 --> 36:21.000
You were away for a year.
Mother missed you so much

36:25.000 --> 36:28.600
Tell us what happened, Fu!

36:29.000 --> 36:31.000
All right, I'll tell you everything

36:31.000 --> 36:36.600
After we succeeded in pleading for rain,
we went on to defeat the Deity of Plague

36:37.000 --> 36:39.000
The Jade Emperor was so pleased

36:40.000 --> 36:42.000
The Deity of Plague?
The Jade Emperor?

36:42.000 --> 36:45.000
In the nick of time...

36:45.000 --> 36:47.000
What's this about the Deity of Plague
and the Jade Emperor?

36:50.000 --> 36:55.000
Well, the Jade Emperor has ordered that
we continue to run the affairs...

36:55.000 --> 36:59.000
of the mortal world, so everybody can
enjoy fortune, prosperity and longevity

36:59.000 --> 37:03.600
Rest assured we'll do our job well

37:04.000 --> 37:08.000
Uncle, since you're an immortal,
do you have to go to Heaven?

37:09.000 --> 37:14.000
I've done many good deeds
for the people, you see

37:14.000 --> 37:19.800
So the Jade Emperor has granted us
a day's leave

37:19.800 --> 37:22.800
-Just one day?
-That's right

37:24.000 --> 37:26.000
So you're leaving again tomorrow?

37:26.000 --> 37:32.000
No. We still have to bring prosperity
and longevity to you in the coming year

37:36.000 --> 37:39.000
So you'll be leaving again next year?

37:39.000 --> 37:45.000
No... A day in Heaven is
a hundred years in the mortal world

37:45.000 --> 37:50.000
You have my word that we'll live in
bliss for the rest of our lives

37:51.000 --> 37:57.600
All of them are reunited. What about
you? Where's my daughter-in-law?

37:57.600 --> 37:59.600
Where's Ruyi?

38:01.000 --> 38:06.000
The Jade Emperor forbids me to see her
in Heaven. I haven't seen her

38:06.000 --> 38:11.600
Is she really missing?
Are you not going to get married?

38:12.000 --> 38:17.600
I don't know. I haven't been able to
locate her. I really miss her

38:18.000 --> 38:19.600
Help!

38:21.800 --> 38:22.800
Hold it there!

38:24.000 --> 38:25.000
Stop there!

38:25.000 --> 38:29.000
How dare you take liberties with women!
I must teach you a lesson!

38:29.000 --> 38:31.000
Ma Ruyi?!

38:33.800 --> 38:34.800
Shou!

38:38.000 --> 38:40.000
How did you get here?

38:40.000 --> 38:43.000
-Don't you want to see me?
-Of course I do

38:44.000 --> 38:48.000
I never dreamt that I'd be able
to see you again in the mortal world

38:48.000 --> 38:52.600
The Jade Emperor won't let us meet, but
the Queen Mother allows me to come down

38:53.000 --> 38:58.000
I'm also to make sure you
set a good example to the mortals,

38:58.000 --> 39:02.000
so they won't think they can count on
your blessings without working hard

39:04.000 --> 39:07.000
Great!
We'll never be separated again!

39:30.600 --> 39:32.600
Busy, Erlang?

39:32.600 --> 39:33.600
Hold it

39:38.000 --> 39:41.000
-What are you doing here?
-I came to drink with you

39:43.000 --> 39:47.600
Cut it out. Are you thinking of sneaking
a glance at the Celestial Mirror?

39:47.600 --> 39:51.000
I'm going to ask for leave of absence
to enjoy life in the mortal world

39:54.000 --> 39:57.000
Is the mortal world
such a wonderful place?

39:57.000 --> 40:00.000
See for yourself!

40:01.000 --> 40:08.000
Every household is living in peace
and enjoying prosperity and longevity

40:08.000 --> 40:11.600
It's all lively and thriving

40:12.000 --> 40:18.600
Look at this place.
It's cold and solitude

40:19.000 --> 40:23.000
Can't talk anymore. I'm going to ask for
leave to go down to the mortal world

40:23.000 --> 40:25.000
It's up to you to come with me

40:29.800 --> 40:30.800
Guolao!

40:31.000 --> 40:33.000
Guard the place

40:42.000 --> 40:44.000
I wish you boundless good fortune!

40:45.000 --> 40:48.600
I wish you a smooth advance
in officialdom!

40:49.000 --> 40:53.000
Great! And I wish all of you
longevity comparable to the mountains!

40:58.000 --> 41:00.000
Wait.
You've forgotten someone

41:07.000 --> 41:11.000
Ouyang Xiaotian? It's been
a long time. How have you been?

41:11.000 --> 41:15.000
I wish you a prosperous New Year

41:16.000 --> 41:19.000
A rare guest!
This adds on to our joy!

41:21.000 --> 41:25.600
We like to joke a lot.
Hope you don't mind

41:26.000 --> 41:30.000
It's New Year and everybody is
doing away with old stuff

41:31.000 --> 41:37.000
Why don't we take this opportunity
to bury the hatchet?

41:37.000 --> 41:39.000
Good idea!

41:39.000 --> 41:41.000
We'll welcome you

41:41.000 --> 41:43.000
Let's welcome Ouyang Xiaotian!

41:43.600 --> 41:45.600
Thanks for giving me this chance

41:45.600 --> 41:49.600
I've realized evil can never
prevail over good

41:50.000 --> 41:53.800
And I'm now able to
tell right from wrong

41:54.000 --> 42:00.000
Right. Harmony breeds wealth, and
a good deed will be returned by another

42:00.000 --> 42:03.000
Enjoy yourselves.
I'd better get back to work

42:04.000 --> 42:08.000
-Your Lordship, don't leave...
-I'm no longer a marquis

42:09.000 --> 42:12.600
Everybody has forgiven you

42:13.000 --> 42:15.000
Nobody is pursuing the matter

42:17.600 --> 42:19.600
Join us for the fun

42:26.000 --> 42:28.600
Don't forget us, Masters!

42:28.600 --> 42:30.600
So you've been hiding

42:31.000 --> 42:33.000
We're here to seek your forgiveness

42:33.000 --> 42:35.000
We won't do evil again

42:35.000 --> 42:37.000
That's right.
We promise

42:37.000 --> 42:39.000
We don't want to become ugly

42:40.000 --> 42:45.000
All right.
Go inside and work

42:46.000 --> 42:50.000
If anybody prays for fortune,
prosperity and longevity,

42:50.000 --> 42:52.000
you must grant him his wish

42:52.000 --> 42:55.000
-We still have to do that?
-That's right

42:56.000 --> 42:59.600
-But he must have a good heart
-Be kind

42:59.600 --> 43:04.000
And his wish must be a kind one.
Only then will it come true

43:04.000 --> 43:05.600
We've got it!

43:15.000 --> 43:21.600
Clean up everything or
I'll starve you for three days!

43:22.000 --> 43:28.600
Please don't bully me anymore.
I've mended my ways

43:31.000 --> 43:36.000
The crew of the Lucky Stars
wish everybody...

43:36.000 --> 43:39.600
a very prosperous New Year!

43:57.000 --> 43:59.000
Subtitled by S Lin
